-> start

=== start ===
I was the one who pointed out the stones of the Temple to him. "Look, Teacher! What massive stones! What magnificent buildings!" I was proud of our city, of our faith's heart.
* [What was his response?] -> response

=== response ===
He looked at me and said, "Do you see all these great buildings? Not one stone here will be left on another; every one will be thrown down." It was... chilling. That's why we came here, to ask him what he meant.
* [Continue] -> closing

=== closing ===
He warned us to be on our guard, that many would come in his name. The end is not yet.
-> DONE